# personal — stays on this laptop, never uploaded
docs/Recruiting_Status_*.md

# LinkedIn's export of his own connections: several hundred real people's
# names, employers and profile URLs. This repository is meant to go public,
# and a CSV committed once stays in the history after it is deleted.
*.csv
!evals/**/*.csv

# The launch handoff note: a working document addressed to the agent, naming
# the private site, the backup repo and where the LinkedIn archive sits. Kept
# on the laptop; never in a public repo.
docs/LAUNCH.md
